# Lantern Ward, an original orchestral nocturne by Tencent HY 4 (tencent/hy4) and SZ.
# Form: prelude, two tutti statements, brass-led development, false recapitulation, cadence,
# 3/4 hemiola, slow chorale, hocket retransition, reprise, subtractive coda.
title: Lantern Ward
composer: Tencent HY 4 & SZ
about: An original nocturne in D minor: a woodwind prelude, a string processional, a brass-led development, a 3/4 hemiola, a slow chorale, a hocket that reassembles the theme without the violins, and a coda that removes one section of the orchestra per bar.
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
key: D minor
style: orchestral
tempo: 76
time: 6/8

