# I. Prelude: silent. II. Bridge: silent.
| R*8 | R*4 |
# III. Tutti I: the theme alone
| D5/4. F5/8 E5/8 D5/8 | Bb4/8 D5/8 F5/4. D5/8 | A5/4. G5/8 F5/8 E5/8 | E5/4. G5/8 E5/8 C5/8 |
| F5/4. A5/8 D6/8 A5/8 | G5/4. Bb5/8 A5/8 G5/8 | C#6/4. E6/8 C#6/8 A5/8 | D6/2. |
# IV. Tutti II: the theme again over the full orchestra
| D5/4. F5/8 E5/8 D5/8 | Bb4/8 D5/8 F5/4. D5/8 | A5/4. G5/8 F5/8 E5/8 | E5/4. G5/8 E5/8 C5/8 |
