# V. Development: the strings become a staccato accompaniment to the brass
| { [A4 D5 F5]/4.' r/4. | [Bb3 D4 F4]/4.' r/4. }*4 |
# VI. False recapitulation: the violins never enter
| R*8 |
# VII. Cadence
| A5/4. D6/4. | [D5 F5 A5]/2. | C#6/4. A5/4. | [D5 F5 A5]/2. |
# VIII. Hemiola, IX. Chorale, X. Hocket: silent
| R*8 | R*10 | R*8 |
# XI. Reprise: the theme returns
| D5/4. F5/8 E5/8 D5/8 | Bb4/8 D5/8 F5/4. D5/8 | A5/4. G5/8 F5/8 E5/8 | E5/4. G5/8 E5/8 C5/8 |
